### 健康檢查
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health
Accept: application/json

###

### 所有醫師
GET http://localhost:8080/api/doctors
Accept: application/json

###

### 依科別篩選
GET http://localhost:8080/api/doctors?department=內科
Accept: application/json

###

### 單一醫師
GET http://localhost:8080/api/doctors/D001
Accept: application/json

###

### 不存在的醫師（應回 404）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/doctors/D999
Accept: application/json

###

### 所有科別
GET http://localhost:8080/api/departments
Accept: application/json

###

### 病患清單
GET http://localhost:8080/api/patients
Accept: application/json

###

### 新增醫師
POST http://localhost:8080/api/doctors
Content-Type: application/json

{ # Changed doctorId to id to match DoctorRequest DTO
    "id": "D006",
    "name": "吳大明醫師",
    "departmentName": "家醫科" # Changed department to departmentName
    # "specialty": "健康檢查、疫苗" # Removed as Doctor entity does not have it
}

###

### 更新醫師
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/doctors/D006
Content-Type: application/json

{ # Changed department to departmentName
    "name": "吳大明醫師",
    "departmentName": "家醫科"
    # "specialty": "健康檢查、疫苗、成人預防保健" # Removed as Doctor entity does not have it
}

###

### 刪除醫師
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/doctors/D006